{"t":"Crossing Kha'labal","s":"crossing-kha-labal-fae74","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Darama_Route_1_bb6d1b.png","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>This page explains the route from <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a> (and/or back) through the continent of <a href=\"#/wiki/Darama\">Darama</a> via the <a href=\"#/wiki/Devourer\">Devourer</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27zeel\">Kha'zeel</a> northern pass, and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27labal\">Kha'labal</a> desert. You won't face many obstacles, most of the route is flat desert.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Equipment_needed:\">Equipment needed:</span></h2>\n<p>None.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Be_prepared_to_face:\">Be prepared to face:</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Sandcrawler\">Sandcrawlers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hyaena\">Hyaenas</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Nomad%20%28Basic%29\">Nomads</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\">Scorpions</a> (<a href=\"#/quest/the-mummys-curse-world-change\">Horestis' Curse</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Honour%20Guard\">Honour Guards</a> (<a href=\"#/quest/the-mummys-curse-world-change\">Horestis' Curse</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Scarab\">Scarabs</a> (digging, raid), <a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\">Larva</a> (raid) , <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarabs</a> (raid).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Maps:\">Maps:</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Darama Route 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"345\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Darama_Route_1_bb6d1b.png\" width=\"421\"/></span><br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Darama Route 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"191\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Darama_Route_2_ea46b8.png\" width=\"192\"/></span><br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Darama Route 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"103\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Darama_Route_3_2b67cd.png\" width=\"127\"/></span><br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Darama Route 4\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"573\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Darama_Route_4_36886e.png\" width=\"521\"/></span><br/>\n</p><p>Note: the order of the maps is from <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>, but if you want to go from <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a> you just need to follow the maps reversed.\n</p><p>See also other <a href=\"#/wiki/Travelling\">Routes</a>.\n</p></div>","quests":[]}